WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.130
Matthew's Gospel says
that when Jesus taught,

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.850
the crowds noticed something different.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.590
He taught them with authority,
and not like the scribes.

4
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:13.550
He taught by his words,
and by the way he lived.

5
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.370
In between, Jesus says he did
not come to destroy the law,

6
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.120
but to fulfil it.

7
00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.480
Then he seems to make it harder.

8
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:24.340
So what did he expect of his followers?

9
00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:27.220
In this mission, you'll
read his words on the law,

10
00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.820
line by line.

11
00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:33.860
Then you'll weigh up a claim: is Jesus'
moral teaching too demanding to follow

12
00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:35.220
today?

13
00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:39.890
Your mission: find out what Jesus
expected of the people who follow him.
